From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Apr 2026 19:01:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix admin ELO adjustments not showing + admin match confirm
 RLS

Problem A: Admin ELO changes were invisible on profile/ranking/find-makker
because filterRatedEloHistoryRows excluded adjustment rows (match_id=null).
Split into filterRatedMatchRows (games/wins) and filterRatedEloHistoryRows
(ELO calc incl. adjustments). Updated all consumers accordingly.

Problem B: Admin could not confirm match results due to missing is_admin()
in match_results UPDATE RLS policy. Added SQL fix with admin access.

Also: admin_adjust_elo now records old_rating/new_rating on adjustment rows,
and existing adjustment rows without old_rating are repaired.

https://claude.ai/code/session_01UJHkwU6DtKxG9A2TXhpVSB
